Cell["\<\
In this Notebook, we give the analytical solution given in Table 2 and 5 as \
Mathematica Functions. 
The dynamics of a mass undergoing Stern Gerlach No-rebook is give as example, \
for different initial states and closed/open conditions. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972378511459218*^9, 3.972378615505312*^9}, {
  3.972378991723857*^9, 
